title: Authorizations › New Case › Referral › Full page: Validation tab
route: /authorizations/new/referral/RF-2053?draft=draft-1001
intro: The nine checks Reader ran on the referral, split by document. Each open finding can be shown in the document, asked of the referrer, or marked OK with a reason.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Click 'Validation'\n(or 'Review findings' on the banner)"
screen sc1 "Summary card\n'6 of 9 checks passed'\n'3 need your attention.' (or 'Everything Reader checked is clear.')\nProgress bar, Reader chip"
screen sc2 "Two lists\n'Referral form' '4 of 7 passed': signature, order not expired, credentials, clinical components, diagnosis, service, urgent criteria\n'Face sheet' '2 of 2 passed': age, contact"
decision d1 "Open and something to ask?\n(a failed age check is never counted)"
click c1 "Click 'Request information for all open findings'"
goto g1 "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Referral › Ask the referrer"

decision d2 "State of one check?"
process r1 "Passed\nGreen tick, check name, what Reader found"
process r2 "Needs attention\nAmber triangle, the problem in a sentence\n'The clinician signature is missing'"
process r3 "Failed\nRed cross (patient under 18)\nNo 'Resolve' menu and no 'Request information': a reply cannot change an age"
process r4 "Resolved\nGreen tick; pill 'Marked OK' with the reason, or 'Fixed by reply' with what it was before"
decision d3 "Referral still open?"
decision d4 "Referral still open?"
click c6 "Click 'Mark OK with reason'\n(the only button on a failed row)"
process r5 "Pill 'Warning' or 'Failed'\nNo buttons: the decision is made"

click c2 "Click 'Show in document'"
process p1 "Document switches to the page and boxes the evidence\nThe tab stays on Validation"
click c3 "Open 'Resolve'"
overlay o1 "Menu\n'Request information'\n'Mark OK with reason'"
click c4 "Pick 'Request information'"
click c5 "Pick 'Mark OK with reason'"
goto g2 "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Referral › Mark OK or decline"

s1 --> sc1 --> sc2
sc1 --> d1
d1 -->|Yes| c1 --> g1
d1 -->|No| sc2
sc2 --> d2
d2 -->|Passed| r1
d2 -->|Warning| r2
d2 -->|Fail| r3
d2 -->|Overridden or replied| r4
r2 --> d3
r3 --> d4
d4 -->|Yes| c6 --> g2
d4 -->|No| r5
d3 -->|Yes| c3 --> o1
d3 -->|No| r5
o1 --> c4 --> g1
o1 --> c5 --> g2
sc2 --> c2 --> p1
